### ti-document-worker — direct call, port 8086
# NOT reachable through the gateway: these endpoints live under /rest/v1/**, and the
# gateway only proxies /api/v1/**. Call the service directly when testing standalone.

### Upload a document file — starts async ETL (embeddings + text sections)
POST http://localhost:8086/rest/v1/documents
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="quarterly-report.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./quarterly-report.pdf
--WebAppBoundary--

###

### Load a document from a URL instead of uploading a file
POST http://localhost:8086/rest/v1/load-url
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "url": "https://example.com/docs/annual-compliance-guide.pdf"
}

###

### Version check
GET http://localhost:8086/rest/v1/version
Accept: text/plain

###
